  "body": "Leave the car at home, head for the beach and enjoy the lifestyle that comes with having so much right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned between Red Beach and Orewa, this charming character villa was relocated to its current site in 1989 and has been thoughtfully upgraded over time. Offering character, versatility and an enviable coastal location, it represents an appealing opportunity to secure a home with plenty of personality.\r\n\r\nFor the current owners, life here has been all about morning beach walks, local markets, community events and stepping outside to enjoy the sunrise.  Cross the road to the Estuary walkway, wander down to the Red Beach shops or head into Orewa for its beach, cafés and restaurants. With easy public transport connections too, it's a wonderfully convenient location. \r\n\r\nAnd there's more to this home than its two-bedroom footprint might suggest. High ceilings, original detailing and light-filled open-plan living bring all the charm you'd expect from a character villa, while a separate study and versatile studio provide valuable extra space for working from home, hobbies or creative pursuits.\r\n\r\nThe home has also benefited from upgrades over time, including re-plumbing, partial re-wiring, a modernised bathroom and additional guest toilet, bringing greater comfort and practicality to everyday living while retaining its original character.\r\n\r\nOutside is another lovely surprise. Tucked privately away from the road, the sun-soaked deck provides the perfect spot for morning coffee, summer evenings or entertaining with friends, with easy flow to the studio and private, fully fenced outdoor spaces.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n- Two bedrooms plus separate study\r\n- Separate versatile studio space\r\n- Light-filled open-plan living with high ceilings and original character\r\n- Private, sun-soaked deck with excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n- Modernised bathroom plus additional guest toilet\r\n- Re-plumbed and partially re-wired\r\n- Separate laundry\r\n- Fully fenced – ideal for children and pets\r\n- Private, easy-care outdoor spaces\r\n- Walk to the beach, local shops and everyday amenities\r\n- Easy access to public transport\r\n- Conveniently positioned between Red Beach and Orewa\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, downsizing or simply looking for a home with a little more character and flexibility, there's much more here than first meets the eye.  A charming home in a location that makes it easy to enjoy the very best of coastal living.",
